  "assets": [
    {
      "uuid": "37e631fb-45d9-49e7-87e6-31fb45d9a9e7",
      "name": "Getting Started.md",
      "path": "Assets/Tutorials/Getting Started.md",
      "assetType": "other",
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "byteLength": 1072,
      "source": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: physics-sandbox\n---\n# Welcome to Nova 26.17 Constraints and cloth puzzle\n\nThis project was created from the **physics-sandbox** template. Open the Scene, Assets, Script, Debug, and Manage workspaces to explore the configured systems. Dismiss this tutorial from its Asset Inspector when you are ready.\n\n## Controls and setup (en)\n\nPress Play. No gameplay input is required; Stop restores the authored scene.\n\n### Expected result\n\nA jointed box, elastic-rope bodies and ground demonstrate gravity and constraints.\n\nRequirements: Ready offline\n\n## Steuerung und Einrichtung (de)\n\nPlay starten. Keine Spieleingabe nötig; Stop stellt die Ausgangsszene wieder her.\n\n### Erwartetes Ergebnis\n\nEine verbundene Box, elastisch verbundene Körper und Boden zeigen Schwerkraft und Zwangsbedingungen.\n\nVoraussetzungen: Offline bereit\n\n## 操作与准备 (zh)\n\n点击播放即可，无需游戏输入；停止后恢复编辑场景。\n\n### 预期结果\n\n带关节方块、弹性绳连接物体与地面展示重力和约束。\n\n使用要求: 离线可用\n",
      "sourceModified": 0,
      "importedAt": 0,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "duration": 0,
      "fontFamily": "",
      "settings": {
        "filterMode": "Linear",
        "compression": "Lossless",
        "pixelsPerUnit": 100,
        "spriteRegion": null,
        "pivot": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.5
        },
        "atlas": false
      },
      "pipeline": {
        "importerVersion": "template-4.2",
        "platform": "web",
        "sourceHash": "975c813ad35a9dd7b08565fca6499a4a08e033c07757bfbda60152b23fba1799",
        "artifactHash": "975c813ad35a9dd7b08565fca6499a4a08e033c07757bfbda60152b23fba1799",
        "contentHash": "975c813ad35a9dd7b08565fca6499a4a08e033c07757bfbda60152b23fba1799",
        "cacheKey": "975c813ad35a9dd7b08565fca6499a4a08e033c07757bfbda60152b23fba1799",
        "status": "ready",
        "lastValidSource": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: physics-sandbox\n---\n# Welcome to Nova 26.17 Constraints and cloth puzzle\n\nThis project was created from the **physics-sandbox** template. Open the Scene, Assets, Script, Debug, and Manage workspaces to explore the configured systems. Dismiss this tutorial from its Asset Inspector when you are ready.\n\n## Controls and setup (en)\n\nPress Play. No gameplay input is required; Stop restores the authored scene.\n\n### Expected result\n\nA jointed box, elastic-rope bodies and ground demonstrate gravity and constraints.\n\nRequirements: Ready offline\n\n## Steuerung und Einrichtung (de)\n\nPlay starten. Keine Spieleingabe nötig; Stop stellt die Ausgangsszene wieder her.\n\n### Erwartetes Ergebnis\n\nEine verbundene Box, elastisch verbundene Körper und Boden zeigen Schwerkraft und Zwangsbedingungen.\n\nVoraussetzungen: Offline bereit\n\n## 操作与准备 (zh)\n\n点击播放即可，无需游戏输入；停止后恢复编辑场景。\n\n### 预期结果\n\n带关节方块、弹性绳连接物体与地面展示重力和约束。\n\n使用要求: 离线可用\n",
        "error": "",
        "dependencies": [],
        "reverseDependencies": [],
        "cacheHit": false
      }
    },
    {
      "uuid": "ae16a50f-4868-49e2-a658-03e9bbc960d9",
      "name": "PhysicsReadout.rhai",
      "path": "Assets/PhysicsReadout.rhai",
      "assetType": "script",
      "mimeType": "text/plain",
      "byteLength": 409,
      "source": "\n@export(type=\"float\", min=0, max=1, step=0.01, group=\"Readout\") let readout_elapsed = 0.0;\nfn update(dt) {\n  readout_elapsed += dt;\n  if readout_elapsed < 0.1 { return; }\n  readout_elapsed = 0.0;\n  let pose = transform();\n  let x = (pose.position_x * 1000.0).round() / 1000.0;\n  let y = (pose.position_y * 1000.0).round() / 1000.0;\n  ui_set_text_on(find_entity_handle(\"Physics Readout\"), `X ${x} Y ${y}`);\n}\n",
      "sourceModified": 0,
      "importedAt": 0,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "duration": 0,
      "fontFamily": "",
      "settings": {
        "filterMode": "Linear",
        "compression": "Lossless",
        "pixelsPerUnit": 100,
        "spriteRegion": null,
        "pivot": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.5
        },
        "atlas": false
      },
      "pipeline": {
        "importerVersion": "template-4.2",
        "platform": "web",
        "sourceHash": "c67b45a87158b6b45c85dced1900ac3d9045f3eea24d131a21d8aefc16dd8982",
        "artifactHash": "c67b45a87158b6b45c85dced1900ac3d9045f3eea24d131a21d8aefc16dd8982",
